        "2024-10-01T01:47:18"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:description "Plastic bolus; smooth to touch; slight resistance to shearing between thumb and fore-finger; will form ribbon of 50 - 75 mm. Clay content in the range from about 35 - 40%." ;
