        "2024-09-30T23:48:37"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:description "Slight coherence, sand grains of medium size: can be sheared between thumb and forefinger to give minimal ribbon of about 3 mm. They have about 5% clay content" ;
    dcterms:modified "2024-09-30T23:48:37"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:definition "Loamy sand is a type of soil that contains a high percentage of sand, along with smaller amounts of silt and clay." ;
